        "correct": false,
        "why": "There is one object."
      },
      {
        "text": "Its methods are all `synchronized`",
        "correct": false,
        "why": "It needs no lock at all."
      },
      {
        "text": "It is immutable: no method changes it",
        "correct": true,
        "why": "Right: lesson 12 section 05."
      }
